WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.166
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:31.166 --> 00:00:34.250
the importance of remembrance
 at the final moment.

3
00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.208
Now in this eighth verse of the eighth chapter,

4
00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:37.291
He sheds special light

5
00:00:37.291 --> 00:00:38.333
on the power of continuous practice

6
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.125
and concentration

7
00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:42.166
that ensures

8
00:00:42.166 --> 00:00:43.083
His remembrance

9
00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:45.875
at the time of death.

10
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:53.083
Lord Krishna here explains

11
00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:55.708
that the mind should always be kept

12
00:00:55.708 --> 00:00:58.916
unwaveringly engaged in His meditation.

13
00:00:58.916 --> 00:01:02.333
Through abhyāsa yoga,
 continuous effort is made

14
00:01:02.333 --> 00:01:04.083
to repeatedly remove the mind
from other subjects

15
00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:05.125
and bring it to the goal,

16
00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:07.291
through which consciousness

17
00:01:07.291 --> 00:01:10.541
starts becoming stable.

18
00:01:10.541 --> 00:01:13.500
Lord Krishna assures Arjuna

19
00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.458
that through this focused meditation,

20
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:16.791
the seeker obtains

21
00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:18.875
the divine Supreme Puruṣa.

22
00:01:18.875 --> 00:01:21.000
Continuous remembrance of Lord Krishna

23
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.000
gives a person power to be freed

24
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.708
from nature's bondages and attachments.

25
00:01:26.708 --> 00:01:28.500
As He explains,

26
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.166
such remembrance expects from you

27
00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:33.875
continuous practice and firm resolve.

28
00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:36.625
When someone practices this throughout life,

29
00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:39.416
then naturally even in the final moment,

30
00:01:39.416 --> 00:01:42.625
their mind remains only in Lord Krishna,

31
00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:46.208
through which the path of liberation is paved.

32
00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:47.208
In this way,

33
00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:48.333
remembrance of Lord Krishna

34
00:01:48.333 --> 00:01:51.083
becomes the supreme form of yoga,

35
00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:56.125
which gives new dimension to a
 person's consciousness and future.

36
00:02:01.166 --> 00:02:04.375
Have you ever thought

37
00:02:04.375 --> 00:02:06.916
what is the root

38
00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:11.208
of supreme achievement in life?

39
00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:16.416
In life, the power of practice is immense.

40
00:02:16.416 --> 00:02:19.375
Just as sun's rays

41
00:02:19.375 --> 00:02:22.166
remove darkness,

42
00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:26.000
similarly the brilliance of continuous practice

43
00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.250
erases life's darkness.

44
00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:30.791
I'm

45
00:02:30.791 --> 00:02:35.916
shedding light here on the importance
 of continuous remembrance,

46
00:02:35.916 --> 00:02:38.125
because your mind and consciousness

47
00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:41.458
get shaped, become formed,

48
00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:46.625
according to what you repeatedly meditate on.

49
00:02:46.625 --> 00:02:48.583
Just as a potter

50
00:02:48.583 --> 00:02:50.833
molds clay in a mold

51
00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:54.000
to make a beautiful pot, similarly

52
00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:58.041
you shape your consciousness –

53
00:02:58.041 --> 00:03:01.583
through your continuous contemplation.

54
00:03:01.583 --> 00:03:04.500
If you want to become proficient

55
00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:07.708
in some skill, habit, or spiritual advancement,

56
00:03:07.708 --> 00:03:11.000
then you must practice it

57
00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.833
with continuity and firmness.

58
00:03:13.833 --> 00:03:16.708
Understand that your mind

59
00:03:16.708 --> 00:03:21.000
by nature is prone to wandering.

60
00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.833
Clouds of thoughts will come and go,

61
00:03:23.833 --> 00:03:26.458
winds in the form of desire and worry

62
00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:31.041
will shake you. But the essence is

63
00:03:31.041 --> 00:03:36.750
that you bring your mind back to your goal.

64
00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:40.750
Just as a gardener repeatedly waters the plant,

65
00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:44.625
similarly you water your goal repeatedly

66
00:03:44.625 --> 00:03:48.000
with dedicated concentration.

67
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.291
In the beginning, this will seem difficult.

68
00:03:51.291 --> 00:03:55.166
Like when you climb a mountain,

69
00:03:55.166 --> 00:03:58.958
in the first stage feet get tired,
 breathing becomes heavy,

70
00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:03.041
but every step keeps making you stronger.

71
00:04:03.041 --> 00:04:05.583
Just like that,

72
00:04:05.583 --> 00:04:08.875
every time you bring your mind back,

73
00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:12.416
you increase your concentration's power.

74
00:04:12.416 --> 00:04:14.916
The more you practice,

75
00:04:14.916 --> 00:04:18.291
the more this will become
 your personality's nature.

76
00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:21.916
Slowly this will become part of your nature,

77
00:04:21.916 --> 00:04:26.250
like a river creates its path.

78
00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:31.166
Remember, practice isn't just repetition,

79
00:04:31.166 --> 00:04:34.166
it's transformation of your inner self.

80
00:04:34.166 --> 00:04:37.208
As you walk on this path,

81
00:04:37.208 --> 00:04:42.541
you'll obtain your supreme form –

82
00:04:42.541 --> 00:04:44.041
this is

83
00:04:44.041 --> 00:04:46.500
My blessing to you.

84
00:04:51.458 --> 00:04:54.708
Just as the entire tree

85
00:04:54.708 --> 00:04:57.875
is hidden in the tree's seed,

86
00:04:57.875 --> 00:05:01.583
similarly saṁskāras given in childhood

87
00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:04.750
flourish throughout life.

88
00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:08.583
In the family, introducing little ones early

89
00:05:08.583 --> 00:05:12.958
to spiritual practice is extremely important.

90
00:05:12.958 --> 00:05:15.750
When you sow seeds of saṁskāras

91
00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:19.291
in tender minds,

92
00:05:19.291 --> 00:05:22.583
then they shape their mind and intellect

93
00:05:22.583 --> 00:05:25.708
in such a way that develops and enables them

94
00:05:25.708 --> 00:05:28.916
for deep contemplation in the future.

95
00:05:28.916 --> 00:05:31.833
When children participate

96
00:05:31.833 --> 00:05:34.583
in simple practices like prayer,

97
00:05:34.583 --> 00:05:37.666
meditation, or listening to spiritual stories,

98
00:05:37.666 --> 00:05:41.791
they learn to concentrate their mind.

99
00:05:41.791 --> 00:05:44.416
This power of concentration

100
00:05:44.416 --> 00:05:47.666
not only strengthens their
 spiritual understanding

101
00:05:47.666 --> 00:05:53.250
but helps in all aspects of life.

102
00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.708
Whether in school

103
00:05:54.708 --> 00:05:57.291
or friendship, in family

104
00:05:57.291 --> 00:05:58.708
or society –

105
00:05:58.708 --> 00:06:01.625
they learn to focus their thoughts

106
00:06:01.625 --> 00:06:06.041
and make wise decisions.

107
00:06:06.041 --> 00:06:07.958
Keep in mind,

108
00:06:07.958 --> 00:06:10.666
in a family where spiritual practice happens,

109
00:06:10.666 --> 00:06:15.000
there remains such peace spread

110
00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.541
that affects all members.

111
00:06:18.541 --> 00:06:21.916
This spiritual practice's sandalwood fragrance

112
00:06:21.916 --> 00:06:25.250
spreads in every corner of the home.

113
00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:27.458
Through this practice,

114
00:06:27.458 --> 00:06:31.458
they build a strong foundation.

115
00:06:31.458 --> 00:06:34.375
When they become adults,

116
00:06:34.375 --> 00:06:38.541
then spiritual teachings become
 even more impactful,

117
00:06:38.541 --> 00:06:41.125
because they've already received training

118
00:06:41.125 --> 00:06:47.875
to see their mind beyond momentary things.

119
00:06:47.875 --> 00:06:50.875
These initial spiritual saṁskāras

120
00:06:50.875 --> 00:06:53.958
become a priceless heritage

121
00:06:53.958 --> 00:06:56.125
that successfully pave the way

122
00:06:56.125 --> 00:07:00.000
in their life and provide capability

123
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:05.125
to establish deep connection with Me.

124
00:07:10.083 --> 00:07:14.041
Look at a skilled archer.

125
00:07:14.041 --> 00:07:17.625
They keep their vision steady on the target,

126
00:07:17.625 --> 00:07:19.583
control their breathing,

127
00:07:19.583 --> 00:07:22.041
and then take aim.

128
00:07:22.041 --> 00:07:26.000
Just like that, professional success also comes

129
00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.500
from concentration and practice.

130
00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:31.750
In your work field,

131
00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.291
you can achieve great heights

132
00:07:34.291 --> 00:07:38.541
if you develop these two powers:

133
00:07:38.541 --> 00:07:42.500
concentrated mind and continuous practice.

134
00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.791
As I explain in the verse,

135
00:07:45.791 --> 00:07:50.041
the power of continuous remembrance and 

136
00:07:50.041 --> 00:07:52.666
dedicated practice creates your path

137
00:07:52.666 --> 00:07:55.916
and determines your success.

138
00:07:55.916 --> 00:07:59.958
In the office, distracting causes

139
00:07:59.958 --> 00:08:02.750
are all around.

140
00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.750
Many projects, deadlines,

141
00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:09.750
meetings – all these will divide your attention.

142
00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:13.500
But just as iron protected by oil coating

143
00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:17.750
doesn't rust even while in water,

144
00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:20.750
similarly the armor of attention's oil

145
00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:25.625
can keep the mind focused unwaveringly

146
00:08:25.625 --> 00:08:28.958
on its goal even amidst all these distractions.

147
00:08:28.958 --> 00:08:31.416
Just as continuous friction of a well's rope

148
00:08:31.416 --> 00:08:34.291
leaves marks even on stone,

149
00:08:34.291 --> 00:08:36.250
similarly continuous practice

150
00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:39.416
makes marks of success even

151
00:08:39.416 --> 00:08:42.958
on your circumstances' hard rock.

152
00:08:42.958 --> 00:08:46.375
Practice with dedication is necessary;

153
00:08:46.375 --> 00:08:47.416
it's continuous effort

154
00:08:47.416 --> 00:08:50.833
to refine one's skills, learn
 from one's experiences,

155
00:08:50.833 --> 00:08:55.583
and face challenges.

156
00:08:55.583 --> 00:08:58.958
This practice done with concentrated mind

157
00:08:58.958 --> 00:09:03.000
becomes one that opens doors of mastery.

158
00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.125
Just as a skilled seeker

159
00:09:05.125 --> 00:09:08.708
obtains supreme bliss from their practice,

160
00:09:08.708 --> 00:09:12.125
similarly you too,

161
00:09:12.125 --> 00:09:14.208
through concentration and
 practice in your work,

162
00:09:14.208 --> 00:09:18.291
obtain not only professional success

163
00:09:18.291 --> 00:09:21.750
but also the experience of self-satisfaction.
